{"candidateAnswer":"Buddies and family members","evidence":"[D15:14 | 9:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Andrew: Totally get it, pets bring such joy and feel like family. I can't imagine life without them.\n[D28:18 | 9:02 am on 22 November, 2023] Andrew: Yeah, it's great! Dogs are always there for us. We should count ourselves lucky to have such amazing furry friends as family member.","itemId":"urn:uuid:31280623-27d5-5ce3-9a33-8e25bd05f9b4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:afeaba5adde9bf67cd89eaa0b7b9092f0cd6cbb52c6d9aa04bd5ba38e32c7cf2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Andrew view his pets as?","referenceAnswer":"Family","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"afeaba5adde9bf67cd89eaa0b7b9092f0cd6cbb52c6d9aa04bd5ba38e32c7cf2"}}]}